PODFoam: optional analysis_func and mesh_func hooks

A python_module.py may define two more functions. mesh_func runs once
before the first step with copies of the cell centres, volumes, solution
directions and cell polygons: in 2D a face of the first empty patch per
cell, in 3D a plane slice of each cell the plane cuts. analysis_func
runs after every step with the time index, snapshot count, residuals,
Courant and continuity numbers and copies of U and p. They change
neither U nor p; with analysis_func the POD step collects a snapshot at
every step. Only the master rank calls them. HOOKS.md has the contract.

